how to run pre_processing.py:
    powershell: python pre_processing.py --ct_folder "Z:\nas-ctm01\datasets\public\lidc_npy\3d\ct" --mask_folder "Z:\nas-ctm01\datasets\public\lidc_npy\3d\lungmask" --output_folder "C:\Users\matil.DESKTOP-6DVD4QL\Desktop\pre_processing_output"
    slurm/linux: python preprocess_ct.py \
        --ct_folder /home/.../CT \
        --mask_folder /home/.../MASK \
        --output_folder /home/.../output


